/* =====================================================================
   BONDS REGISTRY — independent Excel-like grid, saved in its own table (st.bondsRegistry).
   Uses its own state (ui.b), classes (.rc, data-bsel) and actions, so it never touches
   the Consignments grid. Every row gets an automatic date (the day it was created) and the
   month can be closed (locked) with its own table of closings (st.bondCloses), separate from
   the Consignments month closings. Shared helpers only: gTsv, download, xlsx, monthOf, fmtMonth,
   canCloseMonth.
